  ok   a naive expiry in the past is rejected as a plan error

-- Abandoning an unsafe plan does not discard the safe channel
Manual hot water plan could not be made safe in 3 rounds; releasing every forced-off slot on that channel and planning it freely
  ok   the breaching channel is abandoned
  ok   the channel that was never unsafe keeps its pins
  ok   so the space plan the user asked for still holds

-- A released pin is never reported without being planned around
Manual space plan could not be made safe in 3 rounds; releasing every forced-off slot on that channel and planning it freely
  ok   a plan that never converges still terminates
  ok   giving up releases every forced-off slot
  ok   the abandoned plan is as warm as planning freely
  ok   and it heats about as much as planning freely

